'''Deathhawk (Deadly)''' is a special stage that was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] and is available on the '''3rd''' and the '''26th''' of every month if the player has previously completed all [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stages]]. In The Battle Cats Unite, it is available every '''Monday'''. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

